   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Standing on the Moon** (1 review): Reviewer says Standing on the Moon was the main reason for listening [5]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Man Smart, Women Smarter**: rare: 10 archived performances [6]\n- **Dark Star V1**: rare: 12 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2023-06-15.EJL95** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 185 min; rated 3.33/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer calls the recording's sound quality flawless, enough to feel present at the show; Reviewer says the recording sounds very good [3][4]\n- **deadco2023-06-15.jdwtyl**: source not stated; 19 songs; 184 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2023-06-15.EJL95**: taped by Eric Lugassy; transferred by Eric Lugassy; source: Channels 1 & 2: AKG c414 XLII Hypercardioids PAS 20\" apart > Channels 3 & 4: Audio Technica 3031 Cardioids PAS 30\" apart > Channels 5 & 6: Vanguard V1… [1]. Also: Chain: SD recorder to WAV, tracked and normalized in Reaper V6.67, then released as 24-bit FLAC [1]\n- **deadco2023-06-15.jdwtyl**: taped by Jay; transferred by Jay; source: Schoeps CMC622 + Schoeps CMC641>Sound Devices MixPre 6ii [2]",
